    "created_at": "2023-01-12T04:15:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-12T04:15:27Z",
    "body": "> What is the relationship between this and #8687?\r\n\r\nThis is like the intermediate step to get to #8687. If we repurpose none to from-image and re-define none in 1 release, we are worried that some website will suffer regression. So we want to launch this first and send deprecation warning when imageOrientation: 'none' is used, then remove 'none' and finally redefine 'none' to ignore internal image orientation.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
