    "created_at": "2023-01-16T22:11:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-16T22:11:53Z",
    "body": "> I removed the \"implementations can warn\" language as that would require us to acknowledge \"none\" as an official value, which seems like more work than is warranted.\r\n> \r\n> I also changed \"required\" to \"needed\" as \"required\" is a conformance term.\r\n> \r\n> With those changes this looks good to me. I'll let @domenic merge.\r\n\r\nIt makes sense to me! Thank you for making these changes.",
